<title>MEXICO: Telmex 9-mos net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Telmex 9-mos net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	*Shr		1.21				 N.A.</p>
<p>	Net		 10.858 bln	     10.038 bln</p>
<p>	Revs		36.915 bln	     38.488 bln</p>
<p>	Gross profit    20.333 bln	     20.791 bln</p>
<p>	Oper income     13.512 bln	     14.110 bln</p>
<p>	Int fin gain    2.323 bln	  cost2.20 bln</p>
<p>	  Int paid	1.036 bln			  N.A.</p>
<p>	  Int earned    1.537 bln			  N.A.</p>
<p>	  FX gain	 656 million			    N.A.</p>
<p>	  Mon gain	1.166 bln			  N.A.</p>
<p>	  NOTE: Telmex said in a separate statement that its third</p>
<p>quarter earning per share was 0.40 pesos.</p>
<p>	  All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Telefonos de Mexico S.A.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9565</p>
</text>
